; A cost or a price interpolated from a residual of zero is the plain 0,
; whatever exponent the sum of the other postings left: beancount's residual
; inventory is empty then.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Expenses:B

2020-01-02 * "a per-unit cost interpolated to zero"
  Expenses:B    1.00 ABC
  Assets:Cash      8 USD {2020-01-01}
  Assets:A     -1.00 ABC

2020-01-03 * "a total cost interpolated to zero"
  Expenses:B    1.00 ABC
  Assets:Cash      8 USD {{ABC}}
  Assets:A     -1.00 ABC

2020-01-04 * "a price interpolated to zero"
  Expenses:B    1.00 ABC
  Assets:Cash      8 EUR @ ABC
  Assets:A     -1.00 ABC
